News handling: this project stores and serves only headline, publication date,
outlet domain, URL, and machine-generated classification labels. It does not
download, store, or redistribute article bodies. Every item links back to the
original publisher.

No dataset is redistributed in this repository. The `raw/` landing zone is
git-ignored; all data is fetched at run time from the producers above.
